  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w14.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w14.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w14.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w14.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w14.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w14.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w14.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "会社から、事務便が届いた。契約更新の付属書類一式——去年ぶんの写しも、まとめて。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w14.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w14.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "分厚い束を、帳場で一枚ずつ検める。事務便に善意は期待しないが、情報は期待していい。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w14.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w14.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "めくっていて、手が止まった。去年の申請書の裏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w14.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w14.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "——私の判が、並んでいる。一行ズレた最初の判。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w14.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w14.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "訂正申請の判。取り下げの、まっすぐな判。"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w14.node.direction.mimi.shift.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w14.asset.sprite.mimi.smile",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w14.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w14.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "会社の書類は冷たい。なのに、自分の判の並びだけ、妙にあたたかく見えた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w14.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w14.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "縛られながら、それでも一つずつ選んできた列だから。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w14.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w14.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "去年の私から、今年の私への、引き継ぎ書類だった。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w14.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w14.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ノノさんが横から覗いて、しみじみ言った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w14.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w14.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「会社の控えの中にも、ミミさんの歴史があるんですね」ありますとも。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w14.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w14.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "耳が、ちょっとあたたかい。敵の帳簿の中にだって、私の判は私のもの。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s2.w14.node.direction.mimi.shift.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s2.w14.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w14.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w14.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "感傷は、そこまで。更新条項の末尾に、変更を見つけた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w14.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w14.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「異議申立への対応窓口: 再演企画室へ一本化」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w14.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w14.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……こちらの武器(正式な異議)への、防衛工事だ。会社も、学んでいる。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w14.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w14.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "街で、新しい刷り物が出回り始めていた。会社の売店に平積みの『的中率百パーセント予想』。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w14.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w14.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "次の勝敗が、印刷されて売られている。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w14.node.line.006c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w14.line.006c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "当たるから、賭けの意味が死ぬ。一覧の三条目が、店頭に並んだ形だ。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w14.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w14.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "その一面を見て、うちの控室が静まった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w14.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w14.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「次回・黄金ジャックポット杯 勝者: ミミのチーム(的中率100%)」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w14.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w14.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……当たると言われて、こんなに嬉しくない予言があるとは。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w14.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w14.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "予言どおりに勝てば、予想紙の宣伝になる。負ければ、赤線が遠のく。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w14.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w14.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "どちらへ転んでも会社の得に見える盤面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s2.w14.node.line.008c",
      "lineId": "main.s2.w14.line.008c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……見える、だけのはず。胴元が笑っている台ほど、抜け道の探しがいがある。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s2.w14.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s2.w14.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
  "debug": {
    "status": "review",
